-- title:
--   The empty voting configuration has no quorum
-- statement:
--   For every list of node ids `a`: `VotingConfiguration.EMPTY_CONFIG.hasQuorum a = false`, since $0 \cdot 2 > 0$ fails. With the definitions, it follows that `isElectionQuorum` fails at a node whose last committed or last accepted configuration is empty, and `isPublishQuorum` fails at a node whose last committed configuration or `lastPublishedConfiguration` is empty: both require a quorum of each of two configurations.
